# from:length: counts characters and survives very large numbers
>> s := ['ééééééééééééééé'].
Soo-saar qor: (s koobiyee ka: 0 dherer: 20), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (s koobiyee ka: 10 dherer: 20), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (s koobiyee ka: 14 dherer: 1), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (s koobiyee ka-bood: 20), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['-'], sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['abcdef'] ka: 2 dherer: 2), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['abc'] ka: 1 dherer: ['9e300'] tiro), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['abc'] ka: 1 dherer: ['-9e300'] tiro), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['abc'] ka: ['9e300'] tiro dherer: 1), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['-'], sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['abc'] ka: ['-9e300'] tiro dherer: 2), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['abc'] ka: ['nan'] tiro dherer: 2), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['abc'] ka: 0 dherer: ['nan'] tiro), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['-'], sadar-cusub.
